{"cue": 1, "end_ms": 7960, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 4300, "text": "Whoa, something smells like it died and\nwent to hell in here."}
{"cue": 2, "end_ms": 10400, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 9140, "text": "Yeah, I smell it too."}
{"cue": 3, "end_ms": 12440, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 10920, "text": "Must be coming from the kitchen."}
{"cue": 4, "end_ms": 13760, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 12760, "text": "It isn't."}
{"cue": 5, "end_ms": 18140, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 16300, "text": "How do you know, Walt?"}
{"cue": 6, "end_ms": 19940, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 18420, "text": "Because I just tried to order it."}
{"cue": 7, "end_ms": 28300, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 21800, "text": "If my old schnoz is correct, and it\nusually is, the offending aroma is"}
{"cue": 8, "end_ms": 29300, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 28300, "text": "from your table."}
{"cue": 9, "end_ms": 31220, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 30020, "text": "The right corner."}
{"cue": 10, "end_ms": 33900, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 32140, "text": "Somebody has a fish in their possession."}
{"cue": 11, "end_ms": 36000, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 34620, "text": "I believe it is a carp."}
{"cue": 12, "end_ms": 47600, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 45480, "text": "It's not a carp. It's a trout."}
{"cue": 13, "end_ms": 52000, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 49500, "text": "Mac, what are you doing with a dead fish\naround your neck?"}
{"cue": 14, "end_ms": 53260, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 52260, "text": "Come on, Christine."}
{"cue": 15, "end_ms": 55000, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 53320, "text": "A live fish would flop around too much."}
{"cue": 16, "end_ms": 59080, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 57880, "text": "Last night..."}
{"cue": 17, "end_ms": 61740, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 59420, "text": "Quan Li saw a bad omen in my rice."}
{"cue": 18, "end_ms": 66740, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 62440, "text": "And in her village, when you have bad\nluck, they make you wear a fish because"}
{"cue": 19, "end_ms": 68900, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 66740, "text": "they feel it possesses spiritual\nqualities."}
{"cue": 20, "end_ms": 71920, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 69320, "text": "I possess the ability to toss a man 20\nfeet."}
{"cue": 21, "end_ms": 76300, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 75260, "text": "I'll get rid of it."}
{"cue": 22, "end_ms": 80500, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 79500, "text": "Hey, Huck."}
{"cue": 23, "end_ms": 83100, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 82100, "text": "Hi, guys."}
{"cue": 24, "end_ms": 84900, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 83120, "text": "Hi, Harry. What you got there, sir?"}
{"cue": 25, "end_ms": 87440, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 85380, "text": "Two useless scraps of paper."}
{"cue": 26, "end_ms": 91710, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 88430, "text": "The municipal conga till you capsize\nboat party."}
{"cue": 27, "end_ms": 94830, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 93170, "text": "The lieutenant governor schmooze cruise?"}
{"cue": 28, "end_ms": 96650, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 95090, "text": "I would kill for those tickets."}
{"cue": 29, "end_ms": 98770, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 97050, "text": "That sounds like a fun party. What's the\nproblem?"}
{"cue": 30, "end_ms": 102310, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 99050, "text": "Can't find a date. Every girl I ever\nwent out with is busy that night."}
{"cue": 31, "end_ms": 106190, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 102650, "text": "Well, maybe they're all going to a party\nsomeplace, like in a phone booth."}
{"cue": 32, "end_ms": 110650, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 107490, "text": "Harry, any woman would love to go to\nthis thing, even with you."}
{"cue": 33, "end_ms": 113150, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 111870, "text": "Use the tickets."}
{"cue": 34, "end_ms": 114790, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 113690, "text": "It's not that easy, Dan."}
{"cue": 35, "end_ms": 117990, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 115050, "text": "I mean, I got these just a couple of\ndays ago. How do they expect a guy to"}
{"cue": 36, "end_ms": 119350, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 117990, "text": "a date on that short of notice?"}
{"cue": 37, "end_ms": 121370, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 119730, "text": "What were they thinking?"}
{"cue": 38, "end_ms": 124470, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 123290, "text": "Tickets! Where?"}
{"cue": 39, "end_ms": 125690, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 124690, "text": "Cruise. When? Saturday."}
{"cue": 40, "end_ms": 127790, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 125890, "text": "Time? Eight. Here? Sixteen. Okay."}
{"cue": 41, "end_ms": 182240, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 177360, "text": "This is not the Dark Ages. Now, I'm not\nwearing a fish because you saw a vision"}
{"cue": 42, "end_ms": 183320, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 182240, "text": "in your soy sauce."}
{"cue": 43, "end_ms": 188160, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 184240, "text": "But, Mac, it wasn't just that. I also\nhad a dream."}
{"cue": 44, "end_ms": 193940, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 188740, "text": "In the dream was a one -eyed monkey who\nwas there to warn you of danger and a"}
{"cue": 45, "end_ms": 198400, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 193940, "text": "three -legged yak who was there to warn\nyou of evil. And then there was Mel"}
{"cue": 46, "end_ms": 199400, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 198400, "text": "Gibson."}
{"cue": 47, "end_ms": 203500, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 201140, "text": "What was he doing there?"}
{"cue": 48, "end_ms": 206570, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 204280, "text": "Wait. Maybe that was another dream."}
{"cue": 49, "end_ms": 210790, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 207190, "text": "Look, I'm dumping the fish, okay?\nNothing's gonna happen."}
{"cue": 50, "end_ms": 213250, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 211550, "text": "Registered letter for you from the IRS."}
{"cue": 51, "end_ms": 214530, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 213530, "text": "Huh?"}
{"cue": 52, "end_ms": 218390, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 217330, "text": "I'll go get the fish."}
{"cue": 53, "end_ms": 226850, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 224270, "text": "Margaret Turner, New York Journal. Mind\nif I use your phone?"}
{"cue": 54, "end_ms": 229270, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 227390, "text": "What do I care? I'm being audited."}
{"cue": 55, "end_ms": 234590, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 232070, "text": "Christine, am I attractive to women?"}
{"cue": 56, "end_ms": 236100, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 235100, "text": "Oh, you are to me."}
{"cue": 57, "end_ms": 238420, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 236140, "text": "Of course, this woman's married now."}
{"cue": 58, "end_ms": 241080, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 239440, "text": "No, it's a rhetorical question."}
{"cue": 59, "end_ms": 244420, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 241800, "text": "Oh, well, in that case, I find you cute\nas a button, sir."}
{"cue": 60, "end_ms": 248480, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 245580, "text": "Well, if I'm cute as a button, how come\nI'm a one -date wonder?"}
{"cue": 61, "end_ms": 250840, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 249060, "text": "Oh, come on, Harry."}
{"cue": 62, "end_ms": 254020, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 251260, "text": "Don't worry, you'll find your special\nsomeone. It just takes time."}
{"cue": 63, "end_ms": 258540, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 254280, "text": "And as Mel Torme always says, love is\njust around the corner."}
{"cue": 64, "end_ms": 261560, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 259820, "text": "Thank you. I'll try to keep that in\nmind."}
{"cue": 65, "end_ms": 263740, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 262740, "text": "And, Miss Sullivan?"}
{"cue": 66, "end_ms": 264800, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 263800, "text": "Yes, sir."}
{"cue": 67, "end_ms": 266060, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 264840, "text": "Don't ever sing."}
{"cue": 68, "end_ms": 272160, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 267880, "text": "But don't forget, good things happen\nwhen you least expect them."}
{"cue": 69, "end_ms": 289860, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 287360, "text": "Another crackdown on those lowlife\nstreet musicians."}
{"cue": 70, "end_ms": 299950, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 296430, "text": "Look, I'm on a deadline here. I got a\nstory to file by midnight, a four"}
{"cue": 71, "end_ms": 302570, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 299950, "text": "due in the morning, and a heartburn so\nbad you could fry an egg on my chest."}
{"cue": 72, "end_ms": 306290, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 302970, "text": "Look, Ralph, if that photographer's not\nhere in five minutes, just send me over"}
{"cue": 73, "end_ms": 307850, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 306290, "text": "a box of Crayolas, okay, kid?"}
{"cue": 74, "end_ms": 309690, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 308430, "text": "Never mind. He's here."}
{"cue": 75, "end_ms": 313870, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 310910, "text": "For future reference, better late than\nnever is only a figure of speech."}
{"cue": 76, "end_ms": 317170, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 316170, "text": "Well, where's your gear?"}
{"cue": 77, "end_ms": 322110, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 317930, "text": "I don't think I'm who you think I am.\nOh, fine. Let's wait some more time. Who"}
{"cue": 78, "end_ms": 323110, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 322110, "text": "do you think you are?"}
{"cue": 79, "end_ms": 325110, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 323270, "text": "Get those bail reports you wanted, Your\nHonor."}
{"cue": 80, "end_ms": 327479, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 326479, "text": "Your Honor?"}
{"cue": 81, "end_ms": 328760, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 327760, "text": "Sort of a nickname."}
{"cue": 82, "end_ms": 332960, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 330120, "text": "I'm Harry... Stone."}
{"cue": 83, "end_ms": 337820, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 334740, "text": "I am so sorry I didn't know who you\nwere, but I've only just started"}
{"cue": 84, "end_ms": 340620, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 337820, "text": "this courthouse. I'm Margaret Turner of\nthe Journal, and you see, the reason I"}
{"cue": 85, "end_ms": 343040, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 340620, "text": "was using your office is because they're\nremodeling the press room. Hammer,"}
{"cue": 86, "end_ms": 344080, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 343080, "text": "saws, dust."}
{"cue": 87, "end_ms": 346920, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 344160, "text": "Anyway, I just assumed you were the\nphotographer, but of course I was wrong,"}
{"cue": 88, "end_ms": 347839, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 346920, "text": "I'm sorry, and I'm leaving."}
{"cue": 89, "end_ms": 348799, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 347840, "text": "Your Honor."}
{"cue": 90, "end_ms": 349800, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 348800, "text": "No, wait."}
{"cue": 91, "end_ms": 353500, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 350480, "text": "Yes? Stay and use my phone. Really?\nGreat."}
{"cue": 92, "end_ms": 354960, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 353960, "text": "No problem."}
{"cue": 93, "end_ms": 358190, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 356490, "text": "I'm a great admirer of the press."}
{"cue": 94, "end_ms": 360870, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 358650, "text": "Yo, Ralphie, false alarm. Still no\nphotographer."}
{"cue": 95, "end_ms": 364590, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 361270, "text": "I used to have a paper route. And once I\ngot you on the phone, what's the deal"}
{"cue": 96, "end_ms": 366930, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 364590, "text": "with burying my story next to Betty's\nbridge tips?"}
{"cue": 97, "end_ms": 368210, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 367210, "text": "I sold grit."}
{"cue": 98, "end_ms": 370270, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 369270, "text": "Judge, don't."}
{"cue": 99, "end_ms": 372550, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 370750, "text": "Yeah? Close the door on your way out."}
{"cue": 100, "end_ms": 376250, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 375250, "text": "Yeah, yeah."}
{"cue": 101, "end_ms": 384430, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 381830, "text": "I just met the girl of my dreams in\nthere."}
{"cue": 102, "end_ms": 386210, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 385070, "text": "Then how come you split?"}
{"cue": 103, "end_ms": 388770, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 387530, "text": "She threw me out."}
{"cue": 104, "end_ms": 396010, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 393890, "text": "Even in his dreams, he gets the shaft."}
{"cue": 105, "end_ms": 407050, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 402070, "text": "Now, on September 23rd of last year, we\nhad dinner at Sardi's where we discussed"}
{"cue": 106, "end_ms": 408370, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 407050, "text": "that new filing system, right?"}
{"cue": 107, "end_ms": 410230, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 409110, "text": "No, Mac, you're mistaken."}
{"cue": 108, "end_ms": 413790, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 410630, "text": "On September 23rd, I was in the Poconos\nhaving a full body wrap."}
{"cue": 109, "end_ms": 420250, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 415670, "text": "Look, look, just forget it, okay? I'm\njust going to be honest with them. I"}
{"cue": 110, "end_ms": 421209, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 420250, "text": "nothing to hide."}
{"cue": 111, "end_ms": 422810, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 421210, "text": "I don't know why they're picking on me\nanyway."}
{"cue": 112, "end_ms": 425010, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 423470, "text": "Well, you did trash the trout."}
{"cue": 113, "end_ms": 428350, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 425550, "text": "That fish had nothing to do with it."}
{"cue": 114, "end_ms": 430550, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 428770, "text": "Look, just drop it, okay?"}
{"cue": 115, "end_ms": 433470, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 431570, "text": "My luck's no worse than anybody else's."}
{"cue": 116, "end_ms": 456150, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 452490, "text": "Let me guess. Those are for that\nreporter you've been going on about"}
{"cue": 117, "end_ms": 457310, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 456150, "text": "rest of us want to vomit."}
{"cue": 118, "end_ms": 460090, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 458490, "text": "Yeah, ain't she something special?"}
{"cue": 119, "end_ms": 462350, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 460530, "text": "So, you're finally going to ask her out?"}
{"cue": 120, "end_ms": 463570, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 462570, "text": "You bet."}
{"cue": 121, "end_ms": 470250, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 465090, "text": "Oh, of course. What professional,\nsophisticated woman could resist a"}
{"cue": 122, "end_ms": 472390, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 470250, "text": "bouquet and a gag newspaper?"}
{"cue": 123, "end_ms": 478830, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 473550, "text": "I think she might like it. It shows a\nboyish charm and a certain inexpensive"}
{"cue": 124, "end_ms": 479970, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 478830, "text": "sense of fun."}
{"cue": 125, "end_ms": 481370, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 480370, "text": "Oh, yeah."}
{"cue": 126, "end_ms": 483540, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 481580, "text": "All women love cheap, immature men."}
{"cue": 127, "end_ms": 488280, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 487280, "text": "Harry, here's your chance."}
{"cue": 128, "end_ms": 490360, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 489160, "text": "Chuck Stone, nice to see you."}
{"cue": 129, "end_ms": 492800, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 491600, "text": "Harry, it's okay."}
{"cue": 130, "end_ms": 496999, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 496060, "text": "Miss Turner?"}
{"cue": 131, "end_ms": 498000, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 497000, "text": "See you later."}
{"cue": 132, "end_ms": 500820, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 499820, "text": "They're right."}
{"cue": 133, "end_ms": 503160, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 501080, "text": "Love is a many -splendored thing."}
{"cue": 134, "end_ms": 508540, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 504880, "text": "She didn't even notice me. I might as\nwell forget it. Margaret's never going"}
{"cue": 135, "end_ms": 509740, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 508540, "text": "date me. I'm just going to..."}
{"cue": 136, "end_ms": 514500, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 509960, "text": "grow old alone and end up eating frozen\nwaffles and watching endless hours of"}
{"cue": 137, "end_ms": 515500, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 514500, "text": "cable TV."}
{"cue": 138, "end_ms": 519159, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 517679, "text": "He's whining and sulking."}
{"cue": 139, "end_ms": 522980, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 519679, "text": "A sad judge is a slow judge. He may not\nhave a life, but we still do."}
{"cue": 140, "end_ms": 524460, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 523240, "text": "We've got to put a stop to this."}
{"cue": 141, "end_ms": 525700, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 524700, "text": "Harry!"}
{"cue": 142, "end_ms": 530120, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 529120, "text": "Harry!"}
{"cue": 143, "end_ms": 537560, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 530560, "text": "You know, it just occurred to me in all\nthe years"}
{"cue": 144, "end_ms": 541770, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 537560, "text": "we've known each other, I have rarely...\ndone anything for you strictly out of"}
{"cue": 145, "end_ms": 542770, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 541770, "text": "kindness."}
{"cue": 146, "end_ms": 544810, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 543810, "text": "Rarely?"}
{"cue": 147, "end_ms": 546090, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 545030, "text": "How about never?"}
{"cue": 148, "end_ms": 550630, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 546950, "text": "I visited you in the hospital, didn't I?\nI even stopped by the gift shop, bought"}
{"cue": 149, "end_ms": 551529, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 550630, "text": "you that watch."}
{"cue": 150, "end_ms": 553110, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 551530, "text": "You put it on my room bill."}
{"cue": 151, "end_ms": 556470, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 554610, "text": "Insurance paid for it. What's the\nproblem?"}
{"cue": 152, "end_ms": 558210, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 557210, "text": "What's the point?"}
{"cue": 153, "end_ms": 562150, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 559270, "text": "I want to help you score the scribe in\nthe skirt."}
{"cue": 154, "end_ms": 567630, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 564410, "text": "Stan, that's not what I'm looking for.\nYeah, well, no, I know what you want."}
{"cue": 155, "end_ms": 572270, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 567630, "text": "want to establish a solid, meaningful\nrelationship kind of thing."}
{"cue": 156, "end_ms": 577690, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 573950, "text": "Exactly. Well, who better to help break\nthe ice than me?"}
{"cue": 157, "end_ms": 581210, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 580210, "text": "Almost anybody."}
{"cue": 158, "end_ms": 584590, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 583530, "text": "Thanks, but no thanks."}
{"cue": 159, "end_ms": 586470, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 585470, "text": "Yeah, you're right."}
{"cue": 160, "end_ms": 590050, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 586710, "text": "Oh, you better hurry up. Andy of\nMayberry comes on the Superstation in"}
{"cue": 161, "end_ms": 591050, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 590050, "text": "minutes."}
{"cue": 162, "end_ms": 596500, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 595180, "text": "I can help you."}
{"cue": 163, "end_ms": 601220, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 599960, "text": "I'll think about it."}
{"cue": 164, "end_ms": 605600, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 603880, "text": "You look great."}
{"cue": 165, "end_ms": 612260, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 608620, "text": "Until you walk."}
{"cue": 166, "end_ms": 614600, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 613200, "text": "What's wrong with the way I walk?"}
{"cue": 167, "end_ms": 620540, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 615360, "text": "You have to move in such a way... You\nhave... How shall I say this?"}
{"cue": 168, "end_ms": 623080, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 621840, "text": "Walk like a man."}
{"cue": 169, "end_ms": 630090, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 625670, "text": "Walk into a room like a king entering\nhis castle, like a lion entering his"}
{"cue": 170, "end_ms": 632270, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 630310, "text": "Like a clown entering the center ring."}
{"cue": 171, "end_ms": 634450, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 633450, "text": "Attitude check."}
{"cue": 172, "end_ms": 637470, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 635630, "text": "Observe. The walk."}
{"cue": 173, "end_ms": 644550, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 643550, "text": "Right."}
{"cue": 174, "end_ms": 651790, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 650790, "text": "You try."}
{"cue": 175, "end_ms": 685760, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 682640, "text": "That was much better. Now, let's move on\nto the look."}
{"cue": 176, "end_ms": 687200, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 686200, "text": "The look?"}
{"cue": 177, "end_ms": 717910, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 716910, "text": "a stroke."}
{"cue": 178, "end_ms": 719330, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 718330, "text": "Relax,"}
{"cue": 179, "end_ms": 720690, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 719670, "text": "relax. Look takes practice."}
{"cue": 180, "end_ms": 722250, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 721250, "text": "All right, let's do this."}
{"cue": 181, "end_ms": 726670, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 722790, "text": "Let's work on asking for the date. Oh, I\ngot that all worked out. I figured I"}
{"cue": 182, "end_ms": 728250, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 726670, "text": "would break the ice with this."}
{"cue": 183, "end_ms": 730510, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 729130, "text": "Oh, Harry, don't do that."}
{"cue": 184, "end_ms": 733690, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 731310, "text": "Why not, Dan? A lot of women find magic\nfascinating."}
{"cue": 185, "end_ms": 736370, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 733910, "text": "A lot of women find the elephant man\nfascinating. That doesn't mean they want"}
{"cue": 186, "end_ms": 737370, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 736370, "text": "get naked with him."}
{"cue": 187, "end_ms": 739510, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 738510, "text": "All right, let's try this."}
{"cue": 188, "end_ms": 742350, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 739630, "text": "I'll be Margaret. You be the new Harry."}
{"cue": 189, "end_ms": 744870, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 742650, "text": "Oh, Dan, I have had enough. This is\nridiculous."}
{"cue": 190, "end_ms": 748000, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 745600, "text": "The girl of your dreams, Harry."}
{"cue": 191, "end_ms": 752260, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 749460, "text": "The girl of your dreams."}
{"cue": 192, "end_ms": 756340, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 755340, "text": "Okay, okay."}
{"cue": 193, "end_ms": 757700, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 756700, "text": "Remember the walk."}
{"cue": 194, "end_ms": 762280, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 761280, "text": "And the look."}
{"cue": 195, "end_ms": 771320, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 769460, "text": "Margaret, I was... Stop, you sound\ndesperate."}
{"cue": 196, "end_ms": 774780, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 771580, "text": "Look. Harry, Margaret's an aggressive\nwoman. When aggressive women want"}
{"cue": 197, "end_ms": 778120, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 774780, "text": "something, they go for it. Now, stand\nand command."}
{"cue": 198, "end_ms": 782420, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 781320, "text": "Margaret, I... I said command."}
{"cue": 199, "end_ms": 787180, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 783120, "text": "All right, try it again. This time, drop\nyour voice about three octaves."}
{"cue": 200, "end_ms": 789200, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 787680, "text": "Come on, tiger."}
{"cue": 201, "end_ms": 797080, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 791820, "text": "Fine, Dan, I'll do it your way. When\nMargaret comes in, I'll say, Margaret,"}
{"cue": 202, "end_ms": 800380, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 797080, "text": "tonight. You, me, be there."}
{"cue": 203, "end_ms": 801700, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 800700, "text": "Okay."}
{"cue": 204, "end_ms": 813240, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 812240, "text": "use your phone?"}
{"cue": 205, "end_ms": 818260, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 815420, "text": "You keep that up through dinner, and\nyou're home free."}
{"cue": 206, "end_ms": 828240, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 825960, "text": "So, are you ready for your big date with\nthe IRS?"}
{"cue": 207, "end_ms": 830060, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 828900, "text": "Yep, it's all here."}
{"cue": 208, "end_ms": 831700, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 830260, "text": "Nothing to worry about."}
{"cue": 209, "end_ms": 834300, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 832080, "text": "Oh, sure. What's the worst thing that\ncould happen?"}
{"cue": 210, "end_ms": 838960, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 834820, "text": "On the downside, they could throw you in\njail. But on the upside, you might"}
{"cue": 211, "end_ms": 839960, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 838960, "text": "learn a new skill."}
{"cue": 212, "end_ms": 847060, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 845160, "text": "Mag, would you like my lucky four -leaf\nclover?"}
{"cue": 213, "end_ms": 851700, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 850700, "text": "It's in there somewhere."}
{"cue": 214, "end_ms": 856340, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 852320, "text": "Thanks, but no thanks. I don't need a\nclump of dirt to bring me good luck."}
{"cue": 215, "end_ms": 862440, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 861360, "text": "Just do me a favor."}
{"cue": 216, "end_ms": 863960, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 862920, "text": "Fertilize it twice a week."}
{"cue": 217, "end_ms": 868940, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 866360, "text": "Now remember, stick to the plan."}
{"cue": 218, "end_ms": 874240, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 873160, "text": "You be the king."}
{"cue": 219, "end_ms": 878610, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 877450, "text": "What's going on here?"}
{"cue": 220, "end_ms": 880110, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 878830, "text": "I got a date with Margaret."}
{"cue": 221, "end_ms": 882570, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 880550, "text": "And you're taking dating advice from\nDan?"}
{"cue": 222, "end_ms": 887150, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 882930, "text": "Well, it's not exactly advice. You know,\njust some fashion tips and some dining"}
{"cue": 223, "end_ms": 890270, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 887150, "text": "suggestions and a complete change of\npersonality."}
{"cue": 224, "end_ms": 893330, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 891650, "text": "He thinks I need to be more aggressive."}
{"cue": 225, "end_ms": 894610, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 893610, "text": "What do you think?"}
{"cue": 226, "end_ms": 900050, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 894930, "text": "I think Harry Stone is a sweet, lovable,\nwarm, fun guy."}
{"cue": 227, "end_ms": 901530, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 900250, "text": "I wouldn't change a thing."}
{"cue": 228, "end_ms": 904190, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 903190, "text": "You're right."}
{"cue": 229, "end_ms": 905369, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 904410, "text": "You're right."}
{"cue": 230, "end_ms": 906650, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 905370, "text": "These clothes aren't me."}
{"cue": 231, "end_ms": 909470, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 907110, "text": "Although I'm beginning to enjoy the silk\nunderwear."}
{"cue": 232, "end_ms": 915190, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 911450, "text": "I mean, if Margaret can't accept me for\nwho I am, then maybe this thing just"}
{"cue": 233, "end_ms": 916950, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 915190, "text": "wasn't meant to be. Good for you, sir."}
{"cue": 234, "end_ms": 918630, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 917630, "text": "Hi, Christine."}
{"cue": 235, "end_ms": 920150, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 919150, "text": "Hi."}
{"cue": 236, "end_ms": 921430, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 920430, "text": "Ready, Harry?"}
{"cue": 237, "end_ms": 928530, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 924470, "text": "I was born ready, babe."}
{"cue": 238, "end_ms": 953000, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 950380, "text": "What did you think of the handsome cab\nride through Central Park?"}
{"cue": 239, "end_ms": 958500, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 953560, "text": "Well, at first it seemed nice, but when\nyou demanded that the driver go faster"}
{"cue": 240, "end_ms": 961720, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 958500, "text": "and he snapped his whip and the horse\nreared up and nearly flipped us over, it"}
{"cue": 241, "end_ms": 962740, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 961720, "text": "began to lose its charm."}
{"cue": 242, "end_ms": 964720, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 963600, "text": "Do you have a reservation?"}
{"cue": 243, "end_ms": 969820, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 967800, "text": "Fine. Follow me, please."}
{"cue": 244, "end_ms": 973480, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 971560, "text": "I'll have my usual table."}
{"cue": 245, "end_ms": 975540, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 974540, "text": "Of course."}
{"cue": 246, "end_ms": 978000, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 977000, "text": "Is this it?"}
{"cue": 247, "end_ms": 980100, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 979100, "text": "Yes."}
{"cue": 248, "end_ms": 983480, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 982440, "text": "One whole dollar."}
{"cue": 249, "end_ms": 986260, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 984180, "text": "Yes, enjoy your meal, whoever you are."}
{"cue": 250, "end_ms": 992900, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 987760, "text": "Here we go. Oh, no, outside here. I\nalways like to sit facing the room so I"}
{"cue": 251, "end_ms": 993900, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 992900, "text": "see what's going on."}
{"cue": 252, "end_ms": 997800, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 994440, "text": "The action all here, doll."}
{"cue": 253, "end_ms": 1002260, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 999220, "text": "You know, you seem entirely different\naway from work."}
{"cue": 254, "end_ms": 1005940, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1002720, "text": "I do my best work after hours."}
{"cue": 255, "end_ms": 1011920, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1010920, "text": "What's with the eyebrows?"}
{"cue": 256, "end_ms": 1013880, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1012660, "text": "Do you have a tick or something?"}
{"cue": 257, "end_ms": 1020720, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1015660, "text": "I'll order for both of us. I can do that\nmyself. No, no need, no need. We'll"}
{"cue": 258, "end_ms": 1026819, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1020720, "text": "start with the Grand Marnier Farfadet.\nSir, you're ordering from the dessert"}
{"cue": 259, "end_ms": 1027819, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1026819, "text": "menu."}
{"cue": 260, "end_ms": 1030660, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1029660, "text": "I know that."}
{"cue": 261, "end_ms": 1034560, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1031880, "text": "Let's see what wine goes well with\nchocolate."}
{"cue": 262, "end_ms": 1040579, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1036300, "text": "You know, I... Can't decide between the\nchicken cordon bleu or the duck a l"}
{"cue": 263, "end_ms": 1042599, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1040579, "text": "'orange. She'll have the chicken. I'll\nhave the duck."}
{"cue": 264, "end_ms": 1044700, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1042800, "text": "Would madam like soup or salad?"}
{"cue": 265, "end_ms": 1046319, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1045040, "text": "Soup. Salad."}
{"cue": 266, "end_ms": 1048780, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1046579, "text": "Rice pilaf or lyonnaise potatoes?"}
{"cue": 267, "end_ms": 1054340, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1052580, "text": "Both? Neither."}
{"cue": 268, "end_ms": 1057640, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1055400, "text": "Would you like a cocktail before dinner?"}
{"cue": 269, "end_ms": 1059400, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1058400, "text": "No."}
{"cue": 270, "end_ms": 1067520, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1064300, "text": "Did I mention that I'm the youngest\njudge in the history of the state?"}
{"cue": 271, "end_ms": 1072160, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1068100, "text": "Yes, I think I remember you mentioning\nit a few hundred times."}
{"cue": 272, "end_ms": 1075740, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1073780, "text": "Did I mention how I got the appointment?"}
{"cue": 273, "end_ms": 1080180, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1076400, "text": "Yes, you had to fight, fight, fight,\nfight, fight, fight, fight."}
{"cue": 274, "end_ms": 1083380, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1082380, "text": "Right."}
{"cue": 275, "end_ms": 1089580, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1087540, "text": "Would you like to go hunting with me\nsometime?"}
{"cue": 276, "end_ms": 1092960, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1091360, "text": "Excuse me, Harry, I have to powder."}
{"cue": 277, "end_ms": 1094580, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1093580, "text": "Or something."}
{"cue": 278, "end_ms": 1099820, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1098180, "text": "God, I feel like an idiot."}
{"cue": 279, "end_ms": 1103540, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1100640, "text": "I can't be what I'm not, and she doesn't\nlike what I am."}
{"cue": 280, "end_ms": 1105340, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1103900, "text": "Tell the lady I had to leave."}
{"cue": 281, "end_ms": 1107080, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1105920, "text": "This should cover the meal."}
{"cue": 282, "end_ms": 1109200, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1108200, "text": "Okay."}
{"cue": 283, "end_ms": 1120770, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1117710, "text": "I really hate to bother you, but\nsuddenly I'm just not very hungry"}
{"cue": 284, "end_ms": 1122850, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1120770, "text": "should cover our dinner, and if you\ncould tell my friend that I had to"}
{"cue": 285, "end_ms": 1123930, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1122930, "text": "thank you."}
{"cue": 286, "end_ms": 1133530, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1129250, "text": "Hey, did you pass your audit, or are you\ngoing to be slow dancing with the boys"}
{"cue": 287, "end_ms": 1134530, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1133530, "text": "in Attica?"}
{"cue": 288, "end_ms": 1139850, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1136190, "text": "No, no, it went fine, just like I\nthought. And you know something? I did"}
{"cue": 289, "end_ms": 1142110, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1139850, "text": "without any fish or four -leaf clovers."}
{"cue": 290, "end_ms": 1143930, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1142710, "text": "You see, Ross..."}
{"cue": 291, "end_ms": 1150020, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1144240, "text": "You either let fate control you or you\ncontrol fate. I mean, I'm not the kind"}
{"cue": 292, "end_ms": 1152480, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1150020, "text": "man who will let superstition dictate my\nlife."}
{"cue": 293, "end_ms": 1154200, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1152960, "text": "Well, good for you."}
{"cue": 294, "end_ms": 1155920, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1154920, "text": "See ya."}
{"cue": 295, "end_ms": 1160860, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1158560, "text": "What he doesn't know won't hurt him."}
{"cue": 296, "end_ms": 1187890, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1185889, "text": "Yeah. I just came to get my computer."}
{"cue": 297, "end_ms": 1190730, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1189730, "text": "Sure."}
{"cue": 298, "end_ms": 1194150, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1191170, "text": "Pressure's all finished. It looks great.\nThere's new couches, ceiling fans,"}
{"cue": 299, "end_ms": 1195350, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1194350, "text": "plenty of phones."}
{"cue": 300, "end_ms": 1196850, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1195850, "text": "Great."}
{"cue": 301, "end_ms": 1199390, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1198390, "text": "Well."}
{"cue": 302, "end_ms": 1203990, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1202990, "text": "Margaret."}
{"cue": 303, "end_ms": 1209970, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1205870, "text": "I'm sorry about last night. The walking\nout and all. I was way out of line. I'm"}
{"cue": 304, "end_ms": 1212730, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1209970, "text": "sorry, too. I just couldn't help it. You\nwere a..."}
{"cue": 305, "end_ms": 1216660, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1213800, "text": "A bit overbearing, and I didn't think\nyou were like that."}
{"cue": 306, "end_ms": 1218000, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1216920, "text": "I'm not like that."}
{"cue": 307, "end_ms": 1219540, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1218360, "text": "You were last night."}
{"cue": 308, "end_ms": 1222280, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1219820, "text": "Well, that's only because that's the way\nI thought you wanted me to be."}
{"cue": 309, "end_ms": 1223840, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1222560, "text": "Why would you think that?"}
{"cue": 310, "end_ms": 1227620, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1224180, "text": "Because you never even noticed me until\nI ordered you to go out on a date."}
{"cue": 311, "end_ms": 1229520, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1227880, "text": "I always noticed you."}
{"cue": 312, "end_ms": 1235300, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1230760, "text": "You did? Yes, you just never asked me\nout before, and I really wanted you to."}
{"cue": 313, "end_ms": 1237460, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1236460, "text": "You did?"}
{"cue": 314, "end_ms": 1241080, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1238160, "text": "Harry, I was really looking forward to\nlast night."}
{"cue": 315, "end_ms": 1246180, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1242220, "text": "I just wanted to relax and have fun. You\nknow, I don't seem to do much of that"}
{"cue": 316, "end_ms": 1247180, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1246180, "text": "anymore."}
{"cue": 317, "end_ms": 1252300, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1247860, "text": "I live in this world filled with stress,\npressure, and deadlines, and it's"}
{"cue": 318, "end_ms": 1253300, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1252300, "text": "really getting to me."}
{"cue": 319, "end_ms": 1256140, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1254800, "text": "I need some lightness."}
{"cue": 320, "end_ms": 1259860, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1257480, "text": "I need some laughter. I need some fun."}
{"cue": 321, "end_ms": 1262280, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1261080, "text": "Harry, I need a life."}
{"cue": 322, "end_ms": 1266360, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1265360, "text": "So do I."}
{"cue": 323, "end_ms": 1272030, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1268330, "text": "Sounds strange coming from a guy who\njust last night said there's no greater"}
{"cue": 324, "end_ms": 1274850, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1272030, "text": "thrill than racing his Lamborghini on\nthe Autobahn."}
{"cue": 325, "end_ms": 1278910, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1276830, "text": "That guy last night, that wasn't me."}
{"cue": 326, "end_ms": 1282970, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1281970, "text": "This is me."}
{"cue": 327, "end_ms": 1284970, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1283970, "text": "That's adorable."}
{"cue": 328, "end_ms": 1287770, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1286650, "text": "I love magic."}
{"cue": 329, "end_ms": 1294530, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1291110, "text": "You know, if you had been there last\nnight, I wouldn't have walked out."}
{"cue": 330, "end_ms": 1298870, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1295110, "text": "You didn't walk out. I walked out. No,\nyou didn't. I walked out. No, I walked"}
{"cue": 331, "end_ms": 1299870, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1298870, "text": "out. No, I did."}
{"cue": 332, "end_ms": 1302010, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1300690, "text": "You mean we both walked out?"}
{"cue": 333, "end_ms": 1305470, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1303130, "text": "Great first date, huh?"}
{"cue": 334, "end_ms": 1307550, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1306550, "text": "First date?"}
{"cue": 335, "end_ms": 1309890, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1308730, "text": "Are you suggesting another?"}
{"cue": 336, "end_ms": 1315670, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1312250, "text": "Maybe this time we can walk out\ntogether."}
{"cue": 337, "end_ms": 1334700, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1333520, "text": "See, I knew it would work."}
{"cue": 338, "end_ms": 1339000, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1334900, "text": "The walk, the look, the feeling, the\nstick."}
{"cue": 339, "end_ms": 1340820, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1339820, "text": "That's it, Harry."}
{"cue": 340, "end_ms": 1342040, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1340880, "text": "Take control."}
{"cue": 341, "end_ms": 1344520, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1343520, "text": "I will, Dan."}
{"cue": 342, "end_ms": 1346180, "kind": "source_caption", "start_ms": 1345180, "text": "Get out."}
